🏨 Accommodation Module
The Accommodation Module is part of the Event Management System. It manages guest lodging, room allocation, and booking logistics to ensure smooth experiences during events.

✨ Features
Room Allocation: Assign rooms automatically based on availability and guest type (VIP, staff, attendee).

Booking Management: Handle check-in/check-out, cancellations, and modifications.

Guest Profiles: Store preferences such as dietary needs, accessibility, and special requests.

Cost Tracking: Calculate accommodation expenses and generate invoices.

Integration: Sync with event registration so guests are auto-linked to their stay.
